# IntraCore: параметры HAL блока из базы STM32CubeMX (db/mcu/IP/*_Modes.xml).
# Порождено tools/hal_import — руками не править. Формат: src/Docs/Description/HalCatalogFormat.md
[Ip]
Name=LTDC
Version=STM32MP2_lcdtft2_v1_0

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
IOSemaphoreAssignement|IO Semaphore Assignement|||||
HSync|Horizontal Synchronization Width|Synchronization for Width|pixels|1|4095|
HBP|Horizontal Back Porch|Synchronization for Width|pixels|0|4095|
ActiveW|Active Width|Synchronization for Width|pixels|0|1024|
HFP|Horizontal Front Porch|Synchronization for Width|pixels|0|4095|
HorizontalSync|HSync Width|Synchronization for Width|||4095|This register value is equal to (Horizontal Synchronization Width - 1)
AccumulatedHBP|Accumulated Horizontal Back Porch Width|Synchronization for Width|||4095|This register value is equal to the (Horizontal Synchronization Width + Horizontal Back Porch - 1)
AccumulatedActiveW|Accumulated Active Width|Synchronization for Width|||4095|This register value is equal to (Horizontal Synchronization Width + Horizontal Back Porch + Active Width - 1)
TotalWidth|Total Width|Synchronization for Width|||4095|This register value is equal to (Horizontal Synchronization Width + Horizontal Back Porch + Active Width + Horizontal Front Porch - 1)
VSync|Vertical Synchronization Height|Synchronization for Height|lines|1|2047|
VBP|Vertical Back Porch|Synchronization for Height|lines|0|2047|
ActiveH|Active Height|Synchronization for Height|lines|0|768|
VFP|Vertical Front Porch|Synchronization for Height|lines|0|2047|
VerticalSync|VSync Height|Synchronization for Height|||2047|This register value is equal to (Vertical Synchronization Height - 1)
AccumulatedVBP|Accumulated Vertical Back Porch Height|Synchronization for Height|||2047|This register value is equal to the (Vertical Synchronization Height + Vertical Back Porch - 1)
AccumulatedActiveH|Accumulated Active Height|Synchronization for Height|||2047|This register value is equal to the (Vertical Synchronization Height + Vertical Back Porch + Active Height - 1)
TotalHeigh|Total Height|Synchronization for Height|||2047|This register value is equal to the (Vertical Synchronization Height + Vertical Back Porch + Active Height + Vertical Front Porch - 1)
HSPolarity|Horizontal Synchronization Polarity|Signal Polarity||||
VSPolarity|Vertical Synchronization Polarity|Signal Polarity||||
DEPolarity|Data Enable Polarity|Signal Polarity||||
PCPolarity|Pixel Clock Polarity|Signal Polarity||||
Red|Red|Layer Default Color||0|255|
Green|Green|Layer Default Color||0|255|
Blue|Blue|Layer Default Color||0|255|
Reserved|Reserved|||0|255|
SFTrig|The single frame mode|Single frame mode||0|1|Configures the single frame mode
SFExtTrig|External Trigger|Single frame mode||0|1|Configures the single frame mode. External Trigger
YCbCrOrder|Chrominance order|External display interface||||This bit defines the chrominance order (whether Cb or Cr is output first).
YCbCrSel|CCIR hard-wired coefficients|External display interface||||This bit selects the set of CCIR hard-wired coefficients (ITU-R BT.601 or 709).
YCbCrEn|Conversion to YCbCr 422|External display interface||||Configures the output conversion to YCbCr 422.
RotEn|Rotation Enable|Rotation||||
FifoUnderThresh|FIFO underrun at rotation interrupt enable|Rotation||||Configures the Fifo underrun interrupt
Buffer0Addr|Buffer 0 address|Rotation||0|2047|Configures the Buffer 0 address
Buffer1Addr|Buffer 1 address|Rotation||0|2047|Configures the Buffer 1 address
BufferPitch|Buffer pitch|Rotation||0|2047|Configures the Buffer pitch
InterFrameRed|Red component of the rotation|Rotation||0|2047|Configures the Red component of the rotation intermediate frame color
InterFrameGreen|Green component of the rotation|Rotation||0|2047|Configures the Green component of the rotation intermediate frame color
InterFrameBlue|Blue component of the rotation|Rotation||0|2047|Configures the Blue component of the rotation intermediate frame color
Layers|Number of Layers|Number of Layers||||Select the number of layers to configure (max of 3)
LayerIdx_L0|LayerIdx|Layer Default Color||0|1|
Red_L0|Layer 0 - Red|Layer Default Color||0|255|
Green_L0|Layer 0 - Green|Layer Default Color||0|255|
Blue_L0|Layer 0 - Blue|Layer Default Color||0|255|
Alpha0_L0|Layer 0 - Alpha|Layer Default Color||0|255|
WindowX0_L0|Layer 0 - Window Horizontal Start|Windows Position||0|4095|Configures the Window Horizontal Start Position Window X0.
WindowX1_L0|Layer 0 - Window Horizontal Stop|Windows Position||0|4095|Configures the Window Horizontal Stop Position Window X1.
WindowY0_L0|Layer 0 - Window Vertical Start|Windows Position||0|2047|Configures the Window vertical Start Position Window Y0.
WindowY1_L0|Layer 0 - Window Vertical Stop|Windows Position||0|2047|Configures the Window vertical Stop Position Window Y1.
PixelFormat_L0|Layer 0 - Pixel Format|Pixel Parameters||||Specifies the pixel format.
PixelFormat_L0_not888|Layer 0 - Pixel Format|Pixel Parameters||||Specifies the pixel format.
Alpha_L0|Layer 0 - Alpha constant for blending|Blending||0|255|Specifies the constant alpha used for blending.
BlendingFactor1_L0|Layer 0 - Blending Factor1|Blending||||Select the blending factor 1: LTDC_BLENDING_FACTOR1_CA: blending factor is Alpha constant LTDC_BLENDING_FACTOR1_PAxCA: blending factor is Alpha constant x Pixel Alpha
BlendingFactor2_L0|Layer 0 - Blending Factor2|Blending||||Select the blending factor 2. LTDC_BLENDING_FACTOR2_CA: blending factor is Alpha constant LTDC_BLENDING_FACTOR2_PAxCA: blending factor is Alpha constant x Pixel Alpha
BlendingOrder_L0|Layer 0 - BlendingOrder|Blending||0|16|Configures the blending order. This parameter can be one of between Min_Data = 0x00 and Max_Data = 0x0F.
BurstLength_L0|Layer 0 - BurstLength|Blending||0|16|Select the burst length. This parameter must be a number between Min_Data = 0x00 and Max_Data = 0x10.
FBStartAdress_L0|Layer 0 - Color Frame Buffer Start Adress|Frame Buffer||0|4294967295|Configures the color frame buffer address
ImageWidth_L0|Layer 0 - Color Frame Buffer Line Length (Image Width)|Frame Buffer||0|8191|Configures the color frame buffer line length.
ImageHeight_L0|Layer 0 - Color Frame Buffer Number of Lines (Image Height)|Frame Buffer||0|2047|Specifies the number of line in frame buffer.
StartAddressBuffer0_L0|Layer 0 - Start address buffer 0|Auxiliary||0|2047|Configures the start address buffer 0
StartAddressBuffer1_L0|Layer 0 - Start address buffer 1|Auxiliary||0|2047|Configures the start address buffer 1
FrameBufferPich_L0|Layer 0 - Frame Buffer Pich|Auxiliary||0|2047|Configures the frame buffer pich in bytes.
FrameBufferLineLength_L0|Layer 0 - Frame Buffer Line Length|Auxiliary||0|2047|Configures the frame buffer line length.
BufferLineNumber_L0|Layer 0 - Buffer Line Number|Auxiliary||0|2047|Configures the buffer line number.
HorInputSize_L0|Layer 0 - Horizontal input size|Scaler||0|2047|Configures the horizontal input size
VerInputSize_L0|Layer 0 - Vertical input size|Scaler||0|2047|Configures the vertical input size
HorOutputSize_L0|Layer 0 - Horizontal output size|Scaler||0|2047|Configures the horizontal output size
VerOutputSize_L0|Layer 0 - Vertical output size|Scaler||0|2047|Configures the vertical output size
Enable_L0|Layer 0 - Enable|Scaler||||Enabling the Scaler
